git commit -qam "Decide the dead-letter configuration once per update

create_queue validated the DeadLetterQueue/MaxReceiveCount pairing, threw
the result away, and Attributes::apply re-derived the same pairing with a
silent \"ignore half a pair\" branch. The validated value is now passed to
apply, so there is one decision and no unreachable fallback.

